{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。本港今日(10月15日)天氣預測，部分時間有陽光。早上有一兩陣微雨。日間最高氣溫約31度。吹和緩至清勁東風，初時離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><p>展望明日短暫時間有陽光。星期六雲量較多及有一兩陣雨。重陽節及翌日漸轉天晴乾燥。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:37.340723+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T23:16:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:13.220071+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:13.220071+00:00","content_hash":"bcdcdf9b9de2f46ccb04e00d1fbbdc9ee93f548a3195269e168c4fe29cbe8f4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}